<span id="Sx9.T5.1.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="Sx9.T5.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">[1] Spanish is the official language in 20 countries and one U.S. territory (Puerto Rico).</span>
</span></td>
