<td id="Sx9.T5.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">
<span id="Sx9.T5.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="Sx9.T5.1.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">[2] Spanish is widely spoken in regions like the United States, parts of Africa, Asia, and Oceania. ”,</span>
</span></td>
<td id="Sx9.T5.1.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">Geographical Distribution</td></tr>
