<span id="Sx9.T5.1.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">[3] The majority of Spanish speakers reside in Hispanic America, particularly Mexico (largest population of native speakers).</span>
</span></td>
<td id="Sx9.T5.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">Geographical Distribution</td></tr>
